Comment: 0,0:21:54.96,0:21:55.00,Blau drei E,,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.40,0:01:36.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Man, our pitcher yesterday was terrible.}Nuestro{pitcher es algo de baseball, ¿no? Acá prácticamente no existe ese deporte.} {lanzador}lanzador de ayer era terrible.{}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.78,0:01:41.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I couldn't believe it. \NThey should've just put me in like I—}No me lo puedo creer.\N Simplemente deberían hacerme jugar a—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.83,0:01:44.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{We've got an idiot here.}Vaya idiota tenemos aquí.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.25,0:01:46.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Chill out. Relax, me.}Tranquilo. Relájate.{}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.71,0:01:52.21,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{But doesn't he seem thinner?}Pero ¿no te parece más flaco?{AHR #08 [0:12:46.81 -}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.21,0:01:55.13,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Hope he's getting enough to eat.}Espero que esté comiendo bien.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.63,0:01:57.88,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Why not adopt him if you're so worried?}¿Por qué no lo adoptas si tanto te preocupa?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.30,0:01:59.76,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I can't.}No puedo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.76,0:02:02.31,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I'll start to get attached if I take him home.}Me encariñaré si lo llevo a casa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.39,0:02:05.60,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{What's so wrong with that?}¿Qué hay de malo con eso?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.69,0:02:12.19,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{The more things you view as precious,}Mientras más te encariñas con algo,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.19,0:02:15.19,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{the more they weigh you down.}más doloroso te resulta después.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.90,0:02:20.03,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{That's what he said the other night.}Eso fue lo que dijo la otra noche.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.66,0:02:26.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Then the scouts would come and I'd be off to Barcelona.}Y entonces vendrán los cazatalentos, y me iré a Barcelona.{Lu: Deben hablar del Club, aunque no sé bien qué deporte, suponiendo que en un cap. los mostraron jugando a la pelota debe ser eso, por eso "al Barcelona". Yokc}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.37,0:02:29.83,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Pareciera que lo disfruta,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.46,0:02:34.88,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{but does he really think nothing of school or his friends?}pero ¿de verdad no le importan sus amigos ni la escuela?{}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.17,0:02:39.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Mabuchi-kun really said that?}¿En serio dijo eso?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.59,0:02:43.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I think he spends most of his nights wandering around}Creo que se la pasa vangando por ahí todas las noches
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.60,0:02:46.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{and being with people he can't tell us about.}con gente de la que no nos puede hablar al respecto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.35,0:02:51.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Futaba-chan, you sure know a lot.}Futaba-chan, sí que sabes mucho.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.81,0:02:55.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I happened to see him and decided to play detective for a while.}Tuve la suerte de encontrarlo y jugar a la detective un rato.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.15,0:02:57.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{D-Detective?}¿D-Detective?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.28,0:03:00.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{He's messing around and neglecting his studies...}Solo hace el tonto y descuida sus estudios.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.95,0:03:04.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I wonder if he even passed his midterms.}Me pregunto si aprobaría los parciales.{}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.20,0:03:06.74,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You're right to worry about him.}Está bien si te preocupas por él.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.66,0:03:10.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I just overheard Mabuchi and Tanaka-sensei talking.}Acabo de escuchar a Mabuchi y a Tanaka-sensei hablando.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.58,0:03:14.21,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Oh, Kou!}¡Ah, Kou!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.29,0:03:16.84,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{That's Tanaka-sensei's voice.}Esa es la voz de Tanaka-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.42,0:03:20.72,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{What's happened to you?}¿Qué pasa contigo?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.72,0:03:24.64,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Every one of your midterm grades was below average.}Todas tus calificaciones{ parciales (sobra esto)} están por debajo del promedio.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.26,0:03:29.60,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{If you don't pull yourself together, you'll seriously get held back.}Si no mejoras tus notas,\N en serio te quedarás en el mismo año.{}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.60,0:03:33.02,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Whatever. I'll just drop out if that happens.}Da igual. Dejaré la escuela si eso sucede.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.02,0:03:34.52,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Drop out?}¿Dejarla?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.40,0:03:36.65,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{You can't...}Tú...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.65,0:03:40.36,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{You're definitely going to regret it.}Definitivamente lo lamentarás{ si lo dejas pasar}.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.36,0:03:42.86,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Will I really?}¿Realmente lo haré?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.08,0:03:49.16,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Calm down, I was joking.}Tranquilo, es broma.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.88,0:03:59.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I think people who want to quit should just do it,}Pienso que si alguien quiere dejar la escuela está bien,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.76,0:04:02.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{but not if I have to see Tanaka-sensei so sad again.}pero no quiero volver a ver triste a Tanaka-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.09,0:04:06.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{That damn brat.}Ese maldito mocoso.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.01,0:04:12.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Even if he was only joking, \NI don't want to even imagine it.}Aunque haya sido una broma,\Nno quiero siquiera imaginarlo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.52,0:04:21.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{After Mabuchi-kun spent all that time with us at the leadership course,}Después que haber pasado todo ese tiempo{ Mabuchi-kun estuvo todo\N el tiempo}{sobra el mabuchi-kun, se sabe de quién se está hablando en toda la conversación, lo que le sigue es solo por el cambio en el orden de las palabras} con nosotros en el curso de liderazgo,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.15,0:04:25.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{does he really still not think any of it is precious?}¿aún pensará que nada de eso es atesorable?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.08,0:04:34.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm sure that Kou}Estoy segura que Kou...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.21,0:04:38.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{must have his reasons for saying such depressing things.}tiene sus razones para decir cosas tan deprimentes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.17,0:04:41.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{That's what I think.}Eso es lo que pienso.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.63,0:04:47.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{So from here on out, let's do everything we can}Por eso, si de ahora en adelante\Nhacemos que cuente con nosotros,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.60,0:04:49.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{to make sure he can never say those things again.}estoy segura que nunca más dirá algo como eso.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.56,0:04:52.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Futaba-chan, you...}Futaba-chan, en cierto modo...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.52,0:04:55.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I think you've gotten prettier lately.}creo que te ves más bonita últimamente.{hace una ligera pausa, pero esta parte es continuación de la misma oración, por lo que va en minúscula}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.81,0:04:57.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Though you were cute to begin with.}Aunque ya eras linda.{já}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.81,0:05:01.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Huh, really? You're making me blush here.}¿Eh? ¿En serio? Me harás sonrojar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.53,0:05:04.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Actually, I decided to put on some makeup today.}Bueno, hoy decidí ponerme un poco de maquillaje.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.90,0:05:07.74,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Well, look at that. You did.}Ah, es verdad. Se te nota.{Sí lo hiciste.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.62,0:05:09.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Still...}Aun así...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.37,0:05:15.21,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I don't think that's the only reason.}No creo que esa sea la única razón.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.17,0:05:20.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{So today we will review some ancient Chinese history...}Eh, {el "Eh" es opcional (?}ahora repasaremos un poco\N de historia de la antigua China...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.88,0:05:24.05,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{"We'll have fun every time we hang out together."}"Nos divertiremos si estamos juntos".{Lu: Creo no esta citando ningún diálogo dicho antes xd}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.67,0:05:27.26,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{That's what I want Kou to think.}Es lo que quiero que piense Kou.{Lu: No, no cita ninguno.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.72,0:05:30.47,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{How can I get him to be one of us?}¿Cómo hacer que se una a nosotros?
