Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.64,0:06:10.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Let me see that.}Déjame ver eso.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.23,0:06:26.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Just go.}Ya vete.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.70,0:06:31.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{How'd it go?}¿Cómo te fue?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.03,0:06:35.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Idiot. Your stupid note got me in trouble.}Tonta. Tu estúpida notita me metió en problemas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.16,0:06:37.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What, it's my fault?}¿Qué? ¿Ahora es culpa mía?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.16,0:06:40.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You're the one who called him a bald peach.}Tú fuiste quien lo llamó calvo.{pelón.}{(?}{Sorry, calvo > una persona que presenta pérdida de cabello, pelón > alguien que se ha rapado la cabeza}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.88,0:06:42.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¡Bueno, pues es que está calvo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.13,0:06:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fs80\shad0\bord0\c&H90544B&\fncinnamon cake\b1\pos(236.952,577.619)}No se ha ido
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.13,0:06:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fs80\shad0\bord0\c&H90544B&\fncinnamon cake\b1\pos(236.952,577.619)}No se ha ido
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.71,0:06:44.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{His baldness isn't the point.}Que esté calvo no es el punto.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.13,0:06:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fs80\shad0\bord0\c&H90544B&\fncinnamon cake\b1\pos(236.952,577.619)}No se ha ido
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.80,0:06:50.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Is it just me, or is your face different today?}¿Soy yo o tu cara luce diferente hoy? {intentionally blunt/tactless}{aduk sen luudein se sa?}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.85,0:06:55.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I used a bit of makeup.}Me puse un poco de maquillaje.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.01,0:06:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\an2\fsp3\bord3\fs70\shad0\c&HCA9DE7&\3c&HEBE7F9&\fnKG First Time In Forever\b1\move(1465.857,578.000,-200.000,578.000)}Para Kou
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.01,0:06:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\an2\fsp3\bord3\fs70\shad0\c&HCA9DE7&\3c&HEBE7F9&\fnKG First Time In Forever\b1\move(1465.857,578.000,-200.000,578.000)}Para Kou
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.52,0:07:01.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{There's only one reason for a girl who usually goes natural to start using makeup.}Solo hay una razón por la que una chica que siempre va al natural se pondría maquillaje.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.69,0:07:04.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Love, right?}Amor, ¿verdad?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.77,0:07:06.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Bullseye.}Di en el blanco.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.73,0:07:09.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Kou, you say something too.}Kou, di algo también.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.53,0:07:12.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't get cocky, you're just Yoshioka.}No te creas tanto, eres simplemente Yoshioka. {orig: You're getting full of yourself, Yoshioka. Note that you MUST be able to use the latter part in their next exchange}{I was thinking something like "Like you're one to talk, Yoshioka" but ...}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.78,0:07:17.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{And why are you talking like Doraemon?}{wut}¿Qué te pasa que me hablas así?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.50,0:07:21.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{When do you think Futaba-chan will be ready for lunch?}¿Cuándo crees que esté lista Futaba-chan para almorzar?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.58,0:07:25.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Might be a while, so let's just start without her.}Tal vez se tarde un rato, empecemos sin ella.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.46,0:07:26.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sure.}Bien.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.00,0:07:28.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What's that?}¿Qué es eso?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.30,0:07:29.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, this?}¿Esto?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.63,0:07:33.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's the CD Mabuchi-kun lent me!}¡Es el CD que me prestó Mabuchi-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.89,0:07:34.14,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{You're just Yoshioka.}Eres simplemente Yoshioka.{\an8}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.14,0:07:34.72,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{Shut it.}Cállate.{\an8}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.72,0:07:36.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You're just Yoshioka.}Eres simplemente Yoshioka.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.51,0:07:38.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Knock it off!}¡Ya basta!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.06,0:07:41.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Kou, I'm gonna go hit up the shop.}Kou, voy a ir a comprar algo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.23,0:07:43.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sure, I'll come too.}Ah, yo también voy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.48,0:07:44.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't run away!}¡No huyas!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.61,0:07:46.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Tell it to my stomach.}Me muero de hambre...{?}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.27,0:07:50.82,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{No comment about the makeup, huh.}Ningún comentario acerca del maquillaje, ¿eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.49,0:08:00.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Kou, what is it?}Uh, ¿olvidaste algo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.63,0:08:12.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It doesn't suit you.}No te queda bien.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.76,0:08:18.35,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{You're terrible!}¡Qué maldito!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.35,0:08:22.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't come back if that's all you're gonna say!}¡No tiene caso si regresas solo para decirme eso!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.73,0:08:32.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Kou, are you more of a croquette man or a yakisoba-roll man?}Kou, ¿prefieres unas croquetas o un pan de yakisoba?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.90,0:08:36.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Huh? I guess if I had to pick, yakisoba.}¿Eh? Supongo que si tengo que elegir, yakisoba.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.57,0:08:40.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Same here! There's just something about yakisoba on bread that gets me.}¡Yo igual! El pan de yakisoba es el único bueno para mí.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.41,0:08:43.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Mabuchi, haven't seen you around lately.}Mabuchi, tiempo sin verte.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.37,0:08:44.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey.}Hola.{}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.42,0:08:45.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Friends of yours?}¿Amigos tuyos?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.67,0:08:47.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Former classmates.}Viejos compañeros.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.63,0:08:52.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I haven't seen them before.}Nunca nos hemos visto, ¿no?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.13,0:08:57.47,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Looks like you're fitting in with the normal class now. It's like you've always been there.}Pareces encajar perfectamente con una clase normal, como si pertenecieras ahí.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.47,0:08:58.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, thanks.}Sí, gracias.{}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.97,0:09:01.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, you must be in the advanced-track!}¡Oh, ustedes deben estar en las clases avanzadas!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.06,0:09:04.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Come to think of it, Kou,\N weren't you there too last year?}Cierto, Kou, estuviste ahí también el año pasado, ¿no?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.85,0:09:08.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'd totally forgotten, man.}Eres increíble. Lo había olvidado por completo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.07,0:09:13.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's not like Mabuchi ever did well on our tests anyway.}Igual, a Mabuchi nunca le fue \Nmuy bien en nuestros exámenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.03,0:09:15.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{The normals suit you a lot more.}Le va mejor con cosas normales.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.03,0:09:19.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{All last year I was asking myself why you were even in our class.}El año pasado me preguntaba por qué estabas con nosotros.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.28,0:09:25.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I get it now. The only reason you made it was because you were related to Tanaka-sensei.}Ahora lo sé bien. La única razón por la cual pasó eso fue por estar relacionado con Tanaka-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.08,0:09:27.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{No wonder you couldn't keep up.}No fue extraño que no pudieras seguir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.63,0:09:31.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Your brother must be relieved you're where you belong now.}Tu hermano se debió sentir aliviado\N ahora que estás donde debes estar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.50,0:09:32.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I bet.}Seguramente.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.59,0:09:36.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{If you'd actually failed out of the advanced track, he'd be out of a job.}Si te hubiera ido peor en las clases avanzadas, \Nlo hubieran despedido.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.01,0:09:41.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{That's enough out of you.}Ustedes ya se pasaron.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.73,0:09:46.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You piss me off.}Das asco.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.14,0:09:49.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{We're just joking around.}Era solamente una broma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.69,0:09:52.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Then your sense of humor sucks.}Tienes un mal sentido del humor.{Then you have a shitty sense of humor.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.90,0:09:56.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Calm down. What are you so angry for?}Cálmate. ¿Por qué te enojas así?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.99,0:10:02.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Why wouldn't I get pissed off when someone trash talks my friend like that?}{¿Por qué no lo haría cuando le están\N diciendo basuras como esas a mi amigo?}¿Cómo no me voy enojar cuando basuras como ellos hablan así de mi amigo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.54,0:10:05.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Let's go.}Vámonos.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.25,0:10:06.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Why you!}¡Oigan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.71,0:10:11.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Damn those chickens.}Malditos... Se escaparon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.54,0:10:13.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Not so advanced if you—}No sirven las clases avan—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.71,0:10:18.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Those guys tick me off...}Esos tipos me hacen enojar...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.01,0:10:22.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I hate people like that with all my heart.}Odio con todo mi corazón a las personas así.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.45,0:10:41.20,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I should give up...}Debería darme por vencida...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.58,0:10:51.08,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Those two are already...}Esos dos ya están...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.09,0:11:01.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¿Makita?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.39,0:11:04.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Tanaka-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.02,0:11:10.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What's wrong?}¿Qué sucede?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.27,0:11:12.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's Mabuchi-kun.}Es Mabuchi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.48,0:11:16.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hmm? Did he do something to you?}¿Ah? ¿Te hizo algo?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.11,0:11:24.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Is it true that he didn't do well on his midterms?}¿Es cierto que le fue mal en los parciales?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.45,0:11:28.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I can't exactly give out that information to you.}No puedo darte información exacta sobre eso.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.75,0:11:33.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Were you concerned about him?}¿Estás preocupada por él?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.04,0:11:36.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{A little.}Un poco.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.13,0:11:42.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Ever since he was a kid, Kou was one to hold it all in.}Desde que era niño, Kou siempre se reprimía.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.11,0:11:57.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{But to me...}Pero conmigo...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.20,0:12:07.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{He kept coming to me, crying "Nii-chan! Nii-chan!"}Él venía diciendo, "¡Nii-chan! ¡Nii-chan!".
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.45,0:12:09.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{He relied on me without reserve.}Confiaba en mí por completo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.75,0:12:15.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{Nii-chan, it really hurts!}¡Nii-chan, duele mucho!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.92,0:12:18.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{Don't worry, you're doing great.}No te preocupes, estarás bien.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.67,0:12:23.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Just on me.}Solo conmigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.68,0:12:32.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{But he's got good friends who'll worry about him now.}Pero ahora tiene buenos \Namigos que se preocupan por él.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.43,0:12:35.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm sure he'll be able to do his best for you.}Estoy seguro que él también haría lo mismo por ti.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.85,0:12:37.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't worry.}No te preocupes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.61,0:12:42.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Head back to class now. \NLunch is about to end.}Vuelve a tu clase ahora.\N La hora del almuerzo está por terminar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.61,0:12:46.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Okay.}Ajá.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.67,0:13:00.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¿Yuuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.67,0:13:05.38,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{About Mabuchi-kun and his grades...\NCan't we do anything to help him?}Sobre Mabuchi-kun y sus calificaciones...\N ¿No hay algo que podamos hacer para ayudarlo?
