Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.32,0:13:28.87,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kominato-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.87,0:13:30.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yes?}¿Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.24,0:13:33.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Are you free this Saturday?}¿Estás libre el sábado?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.84,0:13:49.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Who the heck is it...}¿Quién rayos es...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.47,0:13:55.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey, Kou? Where you at right now?}¿Ah, Kou?{Lu: "¿Ah, Kou?" ¿Se puede poner así? .-. } ¿Dónde te encuentras ahora?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.43,0:13:59.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Kominato? I'm home.}¿Kominato? Estoy en casa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.19,0:14:01.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Great, that's perfect.}Genial, eso es perfecto.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.40,0:14:04.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{We're having a study party at your house today.}Nos juntaremos en tu casa para estudiar hoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.40,0:14:02.69,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{Should we get this too?}¿Llevamos esto también?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.69,0:14:04.65,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, let's do it!}¡Sí, llevémoslo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.65,0:14:06.86,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{I really love this flavor.}Me encanta este sabor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.07,0:14:06.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{We'll be right over.}Llegaremos de inmediato.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.86,0:14:07.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Bye.}Nos vemos.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.20,0:14:13.29,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What's he going on about...}¿Qué le pasa a este tipo...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.00,0:14:26.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Wait, did he say a study party... here?}Momento, ¿dijo que venían a estudiar... {\i1}aquí{\i0\fscx50} {\fscx100}?{Le he agregado algo más al fscx, no me gusta cuando por italizar algo, los signos tocan la letra contigua, con fscx35 no se veía la tilde de la í.}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.09,0:14:27.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Did I dream it?}¿Un sueño?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.63,0:14:28.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{The lock!}¡El seguro!{Lu: cerrojo?}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.51,0:14:32.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Lock, lock, lock...}El seguro, el seguro, el seguro...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.85,0:14:38.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{G'morning, Mabuchi-kun!}¡Buenos días, Mabuchi-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.90,0:14:44.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Kou's room is pretty big.}El cuarto de Kou es bastante grande.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.86,0:14:47.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, and it's well kept.}Sí, y está bastante ordenado.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.28,0:14:48.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Let's get started.}Comencemos.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.86,0:14:52.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Did you make sure to hide all your indecent books?}¿Te aseguraste de esconder todas las revistas porno?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.28,0:14:56.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You didn't leave me enough time to do anything.}No me dieron tiempo para tanto.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.87,0:15:01.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, right. I brought the CD you lent me.}Ah, cierto. Traje el CD que me prestaste.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.13,0:15:03.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Thanks for it.}Muchas gracias.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.09,0:15:04.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{No problem.}{Oh=No problem.}{ ._.)}Claro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.55,0:15:10.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{We'll be teaching you all of our best subjects.}Te enseñaremos los temas \Nen los que más destacamos.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.01,0:15:12.47,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Huh? Teach me?}¿Ah? ¿Enseñarme?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.47,0:15:17.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You heard her! We'll show those\N advanced-track pricks what's up!}¡Así es! ¡Les mostraremos a esos de la \Nclase avanzada que eres más de lo que dicen!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.64,0:15:23.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{And apologize to Tanaka-sensei, too.}Y así también podrás disculparte con Tanaka-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.52,0:15:26.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{He was really worried about you.}Él está realmente preocupado por ti.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.82,0:15:30.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Nah, forget it.}No, olvídenlo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.24,0:15:31.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Get back up!}¡No te acuestes! {it was a fun time learning what this meant a few years back}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.41,0:15:35.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Even studying can be fun if we all do it together.}Estudiar puede ser algo divertido si lo hacemos juntos.{K}
