Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.95,0:15:40.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Look, I even brought chips!}¡Mira, trajimos papas fritas!{Lu: ¿Solamente en Argentina se dicen "papas fritas"? Sería "patatas" pero yo no le digo así, yokc}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.21,0:15:43.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{He's not taking the bait...}No está mordiendo el anzuelo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.17,0:15:48.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Mabuchi-kun only just woke up, so we can't expect him to get right into it.}Apenas acaba de despertar,\N no podemos esperar que se nos una tan fácilmente.{shu... creo que los japoneses por su idioma usan mucho el nombre de la persona, pero en español no es necesario y hasta resulta redundante, al menos se entiende que están hablando de él, así que pienso que no es necesario empezar la oración con su nombre otra vez}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.67,0:15:53.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I guess so. We'll go ahead and start then.}Ya veo. Bueno, comenzaremos y luego te nos unes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.05,0:15:56.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Kou, come over when you're more awake.}Esperamos que lo hagas cuando estés más despierto.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.43,0:16:00.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey, who's good at math?}Oigan, ¿quién es bueno en matemáticas?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.73,0:16:03.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yo, I'm pretty solid at it.}Ah, yo soy bastante bueno.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.94,0:16:07.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Then maybe you could explain this part.}Entonces podrías ayudarme con esta parte.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.11,0:16:09.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Just leave it to me! Where's the trouble?}¡Déjamelo a mí! ¿Dónde está el problema?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.49,0:16:11.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's over here...}Justo aquí...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.36,0:16:14.16,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Crap, they're so loud.}Rayos, qué ruidosos son.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.16,0:16:16.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I need help with this one.}Yo necesito ayuda con este.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.41,0:16:18.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, me too.}Ah, yo también.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.37,0:16:20.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Let me take a look.}Déjame echar un vistazo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.25,0:16:22.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Okay, I see.}Bien, ya veo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.13,0:16:26.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{How do I start this?}¿Cómo comienzo este?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.38,0:16:29.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{For that one,}Por aquí,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.09,0:16:31.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{you do this here...}y luego haces esto aquí...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.68,0:16:41.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Kominato-kun, stop it! You're getting crumbs all over the place.}¡Kominato-kun, detente! \N¡Estás tirando migajas por todos lados!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.27,0:16:43.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{They're all over our notes!}¡Están sobre nuestras hojas!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.19,0:16:44.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Aw, crap!}¡Ah, rayos!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.91,0:17:04.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{They're not consommé flavored.}No son sabor consomé.{los japos tienen gustos raros}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.17,0:17:07.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Mabuchi-kun got up.}Mabuchi-kun se levantó.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.13,0:17:09.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Those are only for people actually studying.}Son solo para quienes están estudiando en serio.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.46,0:17:11.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, what she said!}¡Ajá, así es!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.59,0:17:14.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Fine.}Ya entendí.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.18,0:17:18.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Kominato, shove over. I need space.}Kominato, muévete un poco. Necesito espacio.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.72,0:17:24.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey, don't push me, Kou.}Oye, no me empujes tanto, Kou.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.44,0:17:28.65,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Yay, Kou joined us!}¡Bien! ¡Kou se nos unió!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.65,0:17:32.78,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{The snacks must've done it. \NLet's keep pushing!}Seguramente fue por los bocadillos.{snackssssss mejor}\N¡Bien, sigamos así!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.78,0:17:35.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Mabuchi-kun, we have chocolate too.}Mabuchi-kun, también trajimos chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.40,0:17:37.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, thank you.}Ah, gracias.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.99,0:17:40.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{So, what are you good at?}Y, uh, ¿en qué eres buena?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.33,0:17:41.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Chemistry.}Química.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.83,0:17:44.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Not what I expected.}No me lo esperaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.16,0:17:45.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I get that a lot.}Me lo dicen seguido.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.50,0:17:49.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Then show me what you've got, Sensei.}Entonces enséñame lo que sabes, Sensei.{el Sensei se queda, ah}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.96,0:17:54.80,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I know he's just making fun of me...}Sé que se está burlando de mí...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.88,0:17:59.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hurry it up already.}Vamos, rápido.{}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.09,0:18:03.06,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{...so why does it feel so good? Am I a pervert?}¿Por qué me siento así?{}\N ¿Seré una pervertida?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.43,0:18:07.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{We can start with the problems from the midterm, okay?}Comencemos con los problemas que había{n}{no, no y no, se prescinde de la "n" en este caso, el plural ya viene expreso en el sujeto de la oración, no es necesario recalcarlo en el verbo} en el parcial, ¿bien?{I... think it's this?}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.27,0:18:09.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Get to it or I'll fall asleep.}Apresúrate o me quedaré dormido.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.10,0:18:11.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hold your horses!}¡Espera un segundo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.02,0:18:13.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Um, Mabuchi-kun!}¡Oye, Mabuchi-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.99,0:18:19.87,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Could you get everyone some cups?}¿Puedes traer algunas tazas para todos?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.87,0:18:21.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, sure.}Sí, claro.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.99,0:18:23.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'll be right back.}Ya vuelvo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.66,0:18:26.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'll find some example questions in the meantime.}Buscaré algunas preguntas como ejemplo mientras.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.31,0:18:47.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Everything alright? Need some help?}¿Todo bien? ¿Necesitas ayuda?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.27,0:18:49.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, thanks.}Ah, gracias.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.39,0:18:53.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{They haven't been used in a while, so I decided to wash them.}Hace mucho que no son usados,\N así es que decidí lavarlos.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.02,0:18:55.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'll dry them off.}Bueno, entonces yo los secaré.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.36,0:18:56.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Thanks.}Gracias.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.61,0:19:01.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You can use this.}Puedes usar esto.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.16,0:19:02.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Okay.}Bien.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.04,0:19:05.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Here.}Toma.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.79,0:19:06.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Okay.}Bien.{ ._.)}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.84,0:19:19.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey, Mabuchi-kun...}Sabes, Mabuchi-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.55,0:19:22.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What do you think of Futaba-chan?}¿Puede ser que a ti, Futaba-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.89,0:19:24.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Do you li—}...te gust—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.39,0:19:29.43,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{If he does...}Si así es...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.60,0:19:32.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, sorry.}Eh, ¿decías?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.56,0:19:37.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I couldn't hear you over the water. What was that?}No pude escucharte por el agua. ¿Lo repites?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.03,0:19:42.03,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{If he tells me that he likes Futaba-chan, what will I do?}Si me dice que le gusta Futaba-chan, ¿qué haré?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.45,0:19:44.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¿Makita?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.79,0:19:49.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sorry, it's nothing!}¡Perdón, no es nada!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.20,0:19:52.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'll take these up first.}Llevaré estas primero.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.88,0:19:57.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sorry, I kicked the bag!}¡Perdón, pateé la bolsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.46,0:19:58.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You klutz.}Torpe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.76,0:20:00.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'll pick it right up!}¡Las recogeré ya mismo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.13,0:20:02.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Did you hurt your foot?}¿Te lastimaste el pie?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.93,0:20:04.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{No, I'm fine.}No, estoy bien.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.40,0:20:15.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Who the heck brought potatoes?}¿Quién diantres trajo papas{kb}?{papas? escucho más continuamente "papas" que "patatas"}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.63,0:20:40.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Those two sure are taking their time.}Esos dos se están tomando su tiempo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.59,0:20:42.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm gonna go check on them.}Iré a ver si están bien.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.80,0:20:44.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Have fun.}Que te vaya bien.{}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.18,0:20:51.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Murao-sama, teach me English.}Murao-sama, enséñame Inglés.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.44,0:20:55.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Fine.}Está bien.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.65,0:21:02.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¿Kou? ¿Yuuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.86,0:21:07.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, there you are.}Oh, ahí están.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.49,0:21:09.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What happened? I thought you'd be right back.}¿Qué pasó? Se están tardando.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.04,0:21:12.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Also, where's Yuuri?}Además, ¿dónde está Yuuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.88,0:21:24.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't worry about it.}No te preocupes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.81,0:21:32.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Did something happen with Kou?}¿Ocurrió algo con Kou?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.03,0:21:43.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Nothing at all.}Nada en absoluto.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.78,0:21:50.28,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Whatever it is, it's not "nothing at all".}Cualquier cosa que sea, no es "nada en absoluto".{me confunde}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.92,0:23:39.94,next time,,0,0,0,,{\1c&HE2A83B&\bord4.5\blur4.88\3c&HEAB021&\pos(219.429,138.571)\fscx75\b0}Siguiente episodio...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.92,0:23:39.94,next time,,0,0,0,,{\1c&HE2A83B&\bord2.5\blur2.88\3c&HEAB021&\pos(219.429,138.571)\fscx75\b0}Siguiente episodio...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:24.92,0:23:39.94,next time,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.25\blur0.5\c&HFFFEF9&\pos(219.429,138.571)\fscx75\b0\3c&HFFFEF4&}Siguiente episodio...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.71,0:23:32.93,AoHaru,,0,400,0,,{You know, when someone keeps dodging their questions,}Cuando preguntas siempre lo mismo,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.93,0:23:35.43,AoHaru,,0,400,0,,{most people don't probe any further.}luego de un tiempo deberías de detenerte.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.31,0:23:38.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You're pretty incredible.}Eres increíble.
